<title>GREECE: IONIAN HOTELS SAYS NO INTEREST TO WORK WITH HYATT.</title>
<headline>IONIAN HOTELS SAYS NO INTEREST TO WORK WITH HYATT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Ionian Bank dismissed press reports that its subsidiary Ionian Hotels was in talks with Hyatt Hotels on assigning management of its two hotels in Athens and Rhodes, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Ionian Bank wishes to clarify that it does not intend to change the management of its two hotels as it honours current contracts,&quot; it said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
